<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.15"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><a href="/what-we-handle/">Services</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</span></nav><p class="kicker">Appraisal service</p><h1>Fire and Smoke Damage Appraisal in Kansas</h1><p class="lede">After a house fire, everything happens at once. The carrier writes an estimate, a contractor writes another, and the gap between cleaning and replacing is often tens of thousands of dollars.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/request-kansas-claim-review/">Free claim review</a></div><dl class="hero-facts"><div><dt>Covers</dt><dd>Structure + contents</dd></div><div><dt>Common gap</dt><dd>Clean vs. replace</dd></div><div><dt>Also</dt><dd>Smoke odor, soot</dd></div></dl></div></section>
<div class="wrap layout"><article class="prose">
<h2>Fire claims are rarely just the burned room</h2>
<p>Heat, smoke and water from firefighting reach well beyond the room where the fire started. Smoke migrates through ductwork, attic space and wall cavities. Soot settles on surfaces in rooms that look clean at first glance. Wet framing and insulation can lead to mold if left in place.</p>
<h2>Common disputes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Cleaning versus replacing smoke-affected drywall, trim, cabinets and HVAC ducts.</li>
<li>Odor sealing and deodorization that never fully works on porous materials.</li>
<li>Structural charring in roof framing missed by a visual inspection.</li>
<li>Code upgrades required for electrical and framing during rebuild.</li>
<li>Contents values: age, condition and replacement prices for hundreds of items.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Contents inventories</h2>
<p>Contents can make up a large share of a fire claim. We help organize inventories room by room with descriptions, ages and current replacement pricing so the panel can value them consistently. Photos, receipts, bank records and even old social media posts help establish what was in the home.</p>
<h2>Rebuild costs in Kansas</h2>
<p>Total and near-total fire losses need a rebuild budget that reflects local labor, permit fees and current material costs. In smaller western Kansas towns, contractor travel and limited trade availability can add real cost that a generic price list ignores.</p>

<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary><span>Should I throw out smoke-damaged items?</span><svg class="pl" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>Not before they’re documented. Photograph and list everything first, and ask the carrier how it wants disposal handled.</p></div></details><details><summary><span>Does appraisal cover contents?</span><svg class="pl" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. If the dispute is over the value of contents, appraisal can set those values.</p></div></details><details><summary><span>Is wildfire damage handled differently?</span><svg class="pl" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>Grass and wildfire claims often involve fences, outbuildings and smoke damage over a wide area. See our wildfire and grass fire appraisal page.</p></div></details></div>
<h2>Related services</h2><div class="rel-grid"><a href="/what-we-handle/wildfire-grass-fire-appraisal/"><small>Service</small><span>Wildfire &amp; Grass Fire Appraisal</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/what-we-handle/farm-ranch-building-appraisal/"><small>Service</small><span>Farm &amp; Ranch Building Appraisal</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/what-we-handle/claim-estimate-review/"><small>Service</small><span>Claim Estimate Review</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
